### Daily purchase count and revenue for the shop site
POST http://localhost:5000/_analytics/api/query
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "site": "shop",
  "event": "purchase",
  "range": "30d",
  "tz": "UTC",
  "interval": "day",
  "metrics": ["events", "sum:revenue_usd"],
  "fill": "none"
}
